+### Duration
+
+The {class}`Duration` type converts a string such as `120`, `90m` or `1h30m` into a {class}`datetime.timedelta`.
+
+```{eval-rst}
+.. click:example::
+
+    @click.command()
+    @click.option("--timeout", type=click.Duration())
+    def wait(timeout):
+        click.echo(timeout)
+
+.. click:run::
+
+    invoke(wait, args=['--timeout=1h30m'])
+    invoke(wait, args=['--timeout=120'])
+```
+
